OL,3,GNEWSASurprise discoveries bring RAF
OL,4,Atwins' story to life
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has revealed how a series of
OL,7,Fchance discoveries led him to discover
OL,8,Fthe truth about how his uncles died
OL,9,Fduring World War Two - and brought to
OL,10,Flight a painting of one of them.
OL,12,FChris Bryan-Smith from Oswestry in
OL,13,FShropshire grew up knowing twin
OL,14,Fbrothers Anthony and Martin Bryan-Smith
OL,15,Fdied while serving with RAF Bomber
OL,16,FCommand.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
