OL,3,GNEWSASurprise discoveries bring RAF
OL,4,Atwins' story to life
OL,5,
OL,6,FImprovements in online databases
OL,7,Fallowed him to look up records and
OL,8,Ftrace where one of the brothers
OL,9,Fcrashed. When he posted the story on
OL,10,FFacebook this summer, he was contacted
OL,11,Fby a surprised RAF museum curator who
OL,12,Fhad the portrait.
OL,14,FBryan-Smith said the eyes of the man he
OL,15,Fsaw in the painting looked so much like
OL,16,Fthose of his own son.
